{"sessionId":"L1-S01","number":1,"sessionTitle":"Hello, Robot!","title":"The Night the Lights Blew Away","titleCard":{"text":"Episode 1. The Night the Lights Blew Away.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S01/title.ogg","dur":3.396,"env":"000ev70dwmolqttvv9e3kzvssqqptrrpoc00000000000pyxyzxvtqi09734vwxwtyuuf2ik20szyzzzzzzvvwyxvtsssql2000000","words":[["Episode",0.1,0.89],["1.",0.89,1.12],["The",1.49,1.71],["Night",1.71,2.03],["the",2.03,2.26],["Lights",2.26,2.63],["Blew",2.63,2.9],["Away.",2.9,3.17]],"voice":"narrator"},"previously":null,"scenes":[{"setting":"Lantern Hill at night: a small town of colourful houses climbing a hill, the sea at the bottom. At the top, the Lantern Clock, its twelve round lights glowing.","action":"Slow camera up the hill. Wind rises; clouds roll in. The twelve lights wobble, pop off and fly away over the roofs like fireflies.","seconds":30,"lines":[{"i":0,"who":"narrator","guestName":null,"text":"This is Lantern Hill. At the very top is the Lantern Clock. It has twelve lights.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S01/0.ogg","dur":5.745,"env":"000drzsgljtlldzwxvtvv8lgsuvoaacszzzvtrppl400000000006ug279v7rywzs4nuzxwm39hytc76ywzyuwuu6nkzyrbdrywuurm44b000000000000006qbbbpyyzyoib0f5xxtqqqqn74lutsrpqpk206hjc000000000000","words":[["This",0.1,0.41],["is",0.41,0.6],["Lantern",0.6,1.07],["Hill.",1.07,1.38],["At",1.74,1.9],["the",1.9,2.09],["very",2.09,2.33],["top",2.33,2.52],["is",2.52,2.68],["the",2.68,2.87],["Lantern",2.87,3.24],["Clock.",3.24,3.52],["It",4.02,4.23],["has",4.23,4.49],["twelve",4.49,4.92],["lights.",4.92,5.36]],"voice":"narrator"},{"i":1,"who":"narrator","guestName":null,"text":"One night, a big wind came. Whooosh!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S01/1.ogg","dur":3.252,"env":"000qzuxyyyvrporoh500a40000fsk70zzyo06bzzwwxsdb09bgspnqqpppm4000000000000008zzzzzzwwtenpkjf60000000","words":[["One",0.1,0.39],["night,",0.39,0.81],["a",0.81,0.98],["big",0.98,1.27],["wind",1.27,1.62],["came.",1.62,1.98],["Whooosh!",2.49,3.02]],"voice":"narrator"},{"i":2,"who":"narrator","guestName":null,"text":"And all twelve lights blew away!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S01/2.ogg","dur":2.176,"env":"000gzpm55zzzzcdi9qzzwtpo74rqsrpf0ef00xuzywxwroqttqppqooppn80000000","words":[["And",0.1,0.34],["all",0.34,0.57],["twelve",0.57,0.97],["lights",0.97,1.36],["blew",1.36,1.65],["away!",1.65,1.94]],"voice":"narrator"}]},{"setting":"Morning. Nana Lucía’s workshop: shelves of jars full of bolts, a big wooden table, sun through the window.","action":"Amara runs in with a newspaper. Spark hovers, worried. Bolt chases his own antenna tail.","seconds":30,"lines":[{"i":3,"who":"amara","guestName":null,"text":"Nana! The clock has no lights! And the Night of a Hundred Lights is coming soon!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S01/3.ogg","dur":5.54,"env":"000000002zzzzzzyvulmi8000000000000000000003rc78fzzzr54ltsjtzssrsuoptqmmme0003bd8600000000000000dttzzuvyxwuqmxoutnhnquwkrrihrrrndeomof8pqusqvrhldqnlmjlpm63000000000000","words":[["Nana!",0.3,0.73],["The",1.44,1.66],["clock",1.66,1.97],["has",1.97,2.18],["no",2.18,2.35],["lights!",2.35,2.71],["And",3.19,3.35],["the",3.35,3.52],["Night",3.52,3.75],["of",3.75,3.87],["a",3.87,3.96],["Hundred",3.96,4.27],["Lights",4.27,4.54],["is",4.54,4.66],["coming",4.66,4.93],["soon!",4.93,5.13]],"voice":"amara"},{"i":4,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"Twelve lights, lost all over town. We have to find them!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S01/4.ogg","dur":4.009,"env":"004bwzyzxl67muspomkf4008tqplc00000000eprrpj9plbuvvtlszzm9dmg3iccqjighd86530000000htvvqkvzv5a6ku8b9rxtpronqhozpiiof0000000","words":[["Twelve",0.08,0.58],["lights,",0.58,1.07],["lost",1.07,1.43],["all",1.43,1.73],["over",1.73,2.09],["town.",2.09,2.45],["We",2.73,2.89],["have",2.89,3.13],["to",3.13,3.29],["find",3.29,3.54],["them!",3.54,3.79]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":5,"who":"bolt","guestName":null,"text":"Beep-woof!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S01/5.ogg","dur":1.325,"env":"0qrtq7ntth03200020azzzzk7868542200000000","words":[["Beep",0.06,0.33],["woof!",0.41,1.08]],"voice":"bolt"},{"i":6,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"Then we need one more helper.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S01/6.ogg","dur":2.122,"env":"004yvrvuswxxxwzyzzwzzbfuejyvstvwwvwwvutupnxxwtua0attrsqpm8000000","words":[["Then",0.1,0.41],["we",0.41,0.61],["need",0.61,0.92],["one",0.92,1.18],["more",1.18,1.49],["helper.",1.49,1.92]],"voice":"lucia"}]},{"setting":"Same workshop. A dusty box on a high shelf, tied with string. The label says: FOR A NEW HELPER.","action":"Nana Lucía lifts the box down and blows off the dust. She turns to the camera — to the child.","seconds":25,"lines":[{"i":7,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"When I was young, I built robots. I kept this box for someone new.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S01/7.ogg","dur":4.875,"env":"005srstrougrxjmuxsoppqonk30ntta60mzywh0e73nuwyvta4sqlmg400ltrrpl700000000000000htq3egkw8009ypntp905xusroj90autdeenqwvxlmsrswwqtusyvustrronm90000000","words":[["When",0.1,0.42],["I",0.42,0.56],["was",0.56,0.82],["young,",0.82,1.2],["I",1.2,1.34],["built",1.34,1.72],["robots.",1.72,2.15],["I",2.64,2.78],["kept",2.78,3.09],["this",3.09,3.41],["box",3.41,3.66],["for",3.66,3.92],["someone",3.92,4.4],["new.",4.4,4.66]],"voice":"lucia"},{"i":8,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"Someone just like you.","direction":"Smiles at the camera.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S01/8.ogg","dur":2.041,"env":"002ktsxpquutwvutsrqprpfbsmxtpntqi04auvutsa0eg9mttpppomg4000000","words":[["Someone",0.11,0.72],["just",0.72,1.11],["like",1.11,1.51],["you.",1.51,1.83]],"voice":"lucia"},{"i":9,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"A robot kit! You can build your very own robot!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S01/9.ogg","dur":3.575,"env":"00vxqjfjyzyxf6qusrol742675pl3205kb0000000000000mzzk6fzwuwrezzzysadlyzpdduzztrqika36kokikrssse7rkf20080000000","words":[["A",0.08,0.27],["robot",0.27,0.78],["kit!",0.78,1.14],["You",1.59,1.81],["can",1.81,2.02],["build",2.02,2.33],["your",2.33,2.59],["very",2.59,2.85],["own",2.85,3.06],["robot!",3.06,3.37]],"voice":"spark"}]},{"setting":"Workshop table. A toaster, a toy car and Bolt sit in a row.","action":"Spark points at each one in turn. A ball rolls past Bolt: Bolt’s ears twitch (a glow on his ears), a thought bubble shows a ball, then he runs after it.","seconds":40,"lines":[{"i":10,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"Is a toaster a robot? Hmm. It cannot see you. It cannot decide anything.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S01/10.ogg","dur":4.993,"env":"00xqost7jpzxrkuigptupmiblwttl4lsme533i300000000pqjdoh300000000js757bgqnnhnqla4puzzdlrnihjnhe940000000atr24aeiwvtnspnmb4cmlqpdnmnpdddkokppd38la73000000","words":[["Is",0.08,0.26],["a",0.26,0.39],["toaster",0.39,0.83],["a",0.83,0.96],["robot?",0.96,1.29],["Hmm.",1.58,1.79],["It",2.1,2.28],["cannot",2.28,2.65],["see",2.65,2.88],["you.",2.88,3.11],["It",3.41,3.58],["cannot",3.58,3.95],["decide",3.95,4.31],["anything.",4.31,4.78]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":11,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"Is a toy car a robot? Not if you push it. It does what your hand does.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S01/11.ogg","dur":4.851,"env":"02nnpmo64inwzwf59bkwuqljlldbezutsn7sni620800000000asrppo9brj77akk8254hrqbild60000ic200000000qt9730nzzyuki4kyv7a5mrf6aomljmff82axvpii765tldb0000000","words":[["Is",0.08,0.27],["a",0.27,0.41],["toy",0.41,0.66],["car",0.66,0.91],["a",0.91,1.05],["robot?",1.05,1.41],["Not",1.7,1.93],["if",1.93,2.1],["you",2.1,2.33],["push",2.33,2.61],["it.",2.61,2.79],["It",3.09,3.26],["does",3.26,3.54],["what",3.54,3.81],["your",3.81,4.09],["hand",4.09,4.36],["does.",4.36,4.64]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":12,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"Watch Bolt. He sees the ball. He thinks, \"Ball!\" And he runs!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S01/12.ogg","dur":4.548,"env":"00sxxuse8ld203knlhc72d6200000000ttjuwufuponlkd3t9300zqrrne800000000rvr8646zzuupc6jk60065zxsrt